  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-02-20T00:43:42.360Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Have a feature that detect if VRChat crashes shortly after loading an avatar and blacklist or delay loading that avatar after you restart VRChat.\n\nFor example: You join a world were someone forces you into an avatar that freezes VRChat when loaded locally and every time you restart VRChat.\n\nMaybe one way of preventing this crash loop is by having the the latest avatar to be loaded flagged on your computer somewhere (probably PlayerPrefs) and is unflagged after some time passes but, delay loading that avatar if a new session is started while that flag is still set.",
